(Example Company Employee Handbook) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Leave and Holidays) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive 24 days of paid annual leave per year, accrued monthly.) Tj T*
(Leave requests must be submitted in the HR portal at least 5 working days in advance) Tj T*
(and approved by your manager. Up to 5 unused days can be carried over to the next year.) Tj T*
(Sick leave: up to 10 paid days per year; a medical certificate is required after 3 consecutive days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Expenses and Reimbursement) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Submit expense claims in Expensify within 30 days of the purchase with a receipt attached.) Tj T*
(Meals while travelling are reimbursed up to 40 EUR per day. Flights must be economy class) Tj T*
(and booked through the company travel tool. Claims above 500 EUR need director approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Working Hours and Remote Work) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Core hours are 10:00 to 16:00 local time. Employees may work remotely up to 3 days per week) Tj T*
(with manager agreement. Equipment for home offices \(monitor, chair\) can be requested from IT) Tj T*
(once per 3 years up to a budget of 600 EUR.) Tj T*
